From 4bf27fc6cdb2dc1040a2e02eddea040ba7d05687 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johann Felfer <31707158+HansFel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:42:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(post): Mach3 Mill post for 3-axis mills

Add mach3.cps. T<n> M6 then G43 H<n>, canned cycles G73/G81/G82/G83/
G85/G86/G89 with G98, the dwell unit as a post option (seconds or
milliseconds, as Mach3's "G04 Dwell param in ms" setting), G91.1 in the
header. G41/G42, G84 tapping, probing and a G83 dwell are refused by
name.

Fixes #2482

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
